      "id": 12279,
      "name": "LastFrontiersman",
      "username": "LastFrontiersman",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/7bcc69/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-17T00:33:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi All,</p><p>I think it'd be great to have a console version that you can play on the PS4, Xbox, or Wii U.&nbsp; Maybe just the initial game with no expansions (option for DLC) to introduce it to a wider audience.&nbsp; Note on this, if they do submit it online, I'd like them to subtract the material cost from the cost... I don't necessarily want to pay again for something I already have, but I am willing to pay again for the presumed online features.</p><p>e.g. When I'm not able to round up some friends to play, I might be able to round up some random people online to play.&nbsp; Also, less table space required.</p><p>I do think Wii U is a good place to go, because from my experience this game translated in Japanese is just the sort of thing that could go wildly popular in Japan.&nbsp; (Y'now... that place what invented Pokemon, Yu-Gi-Oh, Final Fantasy?)&nbsp; Japan has an almost fetish for numbers games, especially team based.&nbsp; This really could explode in Japan if they have a reliable translation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
