      "raw": "[quote=\"Silverleaf\"]\n\nWhat do you mean by &quot;the material cost&quot;?The game would cost the same to develop whether you had bought a previous version or not. And no store in the world would discount a CD album for you because you bought the cassette version back in the 80s.\n\n[/quote]\n\nTrue, but quiet a few RPG companies discount the cost of the PDF from the physical version of their product, or out right give away the PDF if you buy the physical product.\n\nThough, those products are both made by the same company, I don&#39;t see how it would work for Sentinels as the game is made by two separate companies.\n",
